{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21043","headline":"感讽六首 六 · 李贺","name":"感讽六首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝶飞红粉台，柳扫吹笙道。\n十日悬户庭，九秋无衰草。\n调歌送风转，杯池白鱼小。\n水宴截香腴，菱科映青罩。\n䒠蒙梨花满，春昏弄长啸。\n唯愁苦花落，不悟世衰到。\n抚旧唯销魂，南山坐悲峭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}